Dead Inside - Nita Strauss ft David Draiman (Disturbed) Guitar Solo Cover 

Nita is one of my favourite guitarists and I was so excited for the opportunity to cover this solo in her latest single featuring David Draiman of Disturbed!

I saw Nita for the first time at the final Mötley Crüe tour when she played with Alice Cooper and I was blown away! Her stagecraft is phenomenal and I left the show feeling really inspired. A few years later I had the opportunity to meet Nita at one of her clinics and not only is she an outstanding artist but she was a genuinely lovely person. I went with two of my bandmates and she took the time to chat to us about our all girl band and offered us lots of encouragement. 

My playing has definitely come a long way since watching her and she was one of the reasons I bought this LTD with a FR/Whammy bar! 'Dead Inside' is my first cover of 2022 and I had so much fun learning this one and even added some harmonies! 

