Thank You Sooooo Much Fun Squad!  We are so so so grateful for all of your love, support and friendship for all of these years!  We wanted to re-create this cover song “10 Million Subscribers” to celebrate our awesome milestone and to say thank you to all of our amazing fans and viewers!  We love what we do and we love making these fun and entertaining videos for everyone!  Sing along to this fun song about all of our fun adventures, collabs, stories, skits, challenges, games, music videos, etc.  We had so much fun filming, recording and putting this video together.  It brings back so many memories!  We hope you like the song and that you will sing it over and over again!  Thanks again!  The Fun Squad subscribers are the best in the whole world! What is your favorite Fun Squad music video?  What is your favorite part of this song? We love doing awesome Fun Squad music videos (either cover songs or original songs).

