Lockdown Licks #55 Energy Joe Satriani 

This is a very special lockdown collaboration with the very talented Jay Seeney from The Jay Seeney Band and Blacklist Productions! Not only has Jay put up with living with me during this entire lockdown, but he was actually the one that inspired me to pick the guitar back up again after finishing high school. His motivation, knowledge and critique has shaped my playing immensely!

We spent a long time deciding on a track to do together. Satriani is a player that we both look up to, and we loved the riffs and licks in Energy. We had a lot of fun putting this short cover together!

After being in lockdown for over two months now I've taken the plunge and started a Patreon page! Any support will go a long way and I'll be sharing heaps of videos, mp3 downloads and even tabs! 🎶

