Lockdown Licks #10 Carrion - Parkway Drive Harmony Cover

Lockdown collab with the insanely talented Emma Louise Nagy! This one's a bit heavier than our previous harmony covers, some drop-tuned guitar action! 🤘🤘

Parkway Drive is one of our favourite Aussie metalcore bands. This riff goes way back to the roots of one of their early albums, Horizons. It's been insane to see this band's progression from their early days in Byron Bay, to headlining the biggest international metal festivals! 🎸🎶

